WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.480
- Before all that. I wanna talk about

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.560
one of the special things
happening this week.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.080
We asked you to take your
Pilot G2 Gel Ink Pens,

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.830
the go to pen of the Kelly Clarkson show

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.340
and submit a handwritten
letter about someone

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.370
overachieving and bringing the
Christmas Spirit to others.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.770
Um, in other words, a real life Santa.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.710
Uh, today's letter comes from
a mom and her twin daughters.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.570
Let's say hi to Laticia
and her little girls

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:21.822
Luna and Jonella.

00:00:21.822 --> 00:00:22.810
(Audience cheering)

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.555
We have them on the line right now.

00:00:24.555 --> 00:00:26.731
(Audience clapping)

00:00:26.731 --> 00:00:27.778
[Kelly] Hi y'all!

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:29.064
- Hi

00:00:29.064 --> 00:00:30.920
[Kelly] Okay. So Merry
Christmas to all of you.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.430
First of all, and you look beautiful.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:34.936
- Thank you! Merry Christmas to you.

00:00:34.936 --> 00:00:37.952
- Absolutely. So Laticia
can you read us your letter?

00:00:37.952 --> 00:00:40.882
[Laticia] Yes, Dear Kelly.

00:00:40.882 --> 00:00:44.584
I want to tell you about
my kids' real life Santa.

00:00:44.584 --> 00:00:47.882
We call him Alvin the Elf. Last Christmas,

00:00:47.882 --> 00:00:51.745
my four year old twins wrote
letters to Santa and attached

00:00:51.745 --> 00:00:52.778
them to balloons.

00:00:52.778 --> 00:00:57.778
Alvin found one balloon 600
miles away in Louisiana.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.430
He got the girls everything on the list,

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.512
but there was one gift he
couldn't ship. A puppy.

00:01:03.512 --> 00:01:06.650
So he actually drove to
us and gave them their

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.560
brand new puppy, Max.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:11.367
If that's not a real life
Santa, I don't know what is.

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:16.041
[Kelly] That's so magical. So
wait we have a picture of Max

00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:19.670
right now and also Max
is taking a nap. Oh my...

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:25.640
Oh my God! And that dog,
that dog is so cute!

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:29.210
Oh my gosh. So here's what's cool.

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:32.030
Um, Alvin is also dialed
in, but he has no idea

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.486
Laticia and her girls called
him their real life Santa.

00:01:35.486 --> 00:01:36.836
(Singing) "Real Life Santa"

00:01:40.515 --> 00:01:42.770
[Kelly] We'll hide
Leticia, Luna and Jonella

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:44.770
until we're ready to reveal the surprise.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.982
So, let's bring Alvin in here. All right.

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:48.269
Hi Alvin!

00:01:48.269 --> 00:01:51.278
(Audience applause)

00:01:51.278 --> 00:01:54.980
Hello!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:57.090
It's nice to meet you. Can you,

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.630
can you tell us about finding the balloon?

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:03.440
- Sure. Uh, last December
I was down in Grand Cane,

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:07.087
Louisiana, deer hunting. And
while I was in the woods,

00:02:07.087 --> 00:02:11.960
I came across a Red Mylar
Balloon. So I went to investigate.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:14.410
And when I got the ballon,
retrieved the balloon,

00:02:15.493 --> 00:02:18.030
there was a note attached to it.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:21.908
So I opened it up and it
was supposed to go to Santa.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:26.583
So my wife got on the internet
and I asked people to share

00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:31.583
it. And we had over 220 shares. And in

00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:32.666
- Oh wow!

00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:34.937
- less than 24 hours,
we had found the family.

00:02:34.937 --> 00:02:35.945
(Audience claps)

00:02:35.945 --> 00:02:39.980
[Kelly] Oh my gosh! Um well,
I love what you did for them.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:42.520
You ended up actually
getting the stuff, right?

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.817
- Yeah. My wife then posted an update

00:02:44.817 --> 00:02:49.550
that we found the family and
we didn't ask for donations

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:52.465
uh and people, just coworkers, family,

00:02:52.465 --> 00:02:54.863
everybody just started donating.

00:02:54.863 --> 00:02:59.863
We shipped five boxes of toys,
uh clothes, play clothes,

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.330
stuffed animals, blankets, and
all kinds of stuff to them.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:10.180
But the one thing we could not
ship to them that I talked to

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.616
their mom about was a puppy.

00:03:12.616 --> 00:03:17.170
We made an arrangement once
he got old enough and we drove

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:21.720
up there and met the family
and it was instant connection.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:25.393
They love the puppy. They
loved us and we love them.

00:03:25.393 --> 00:03:26.226
[Kelly] Aw!

00:03:26.226 --> 00:03:30.840
- Now we have an extended
family and I'm an only child.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:35.900
And she's like my little sister
and we talked and we still

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.127
talk and text each way, three
or four times a week or more.

00:03:39.127 --> 00:03:41.890
[Kelly] Oh my gosh. Okay. I'm
emotional. Don't say that.

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:44.460
Okay. Woo! Everyday,
what am I talking about?

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.030
Well, here's something that
you don't know, uh Laticia

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.710
and her girls wrote to me saying
that you are actually their

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:54.150
real life Santa. Um, and they're
on the line and they have

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:57.880
something they want to
say to you. So, Laticia,

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:58.784
kids go for it.

00:03:58.784 --> 00:04:00.322
(Audience Applause)

00:04:00.322 --> 00:04:01.162
- Hi Alvin!

00:04:01.162 --> 00:04:02.028
- Hi Alvin!

00:04:02.028 --> 00:04:06.910
- Alvin, we want to let you
know that you mean so much

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:10.567
to us. You're such a genuine
person who deserves it all,

00:04:10.567 --> 00:04:13.080
you know from the moment that we met you,

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:15.580
we knew that you weren't
just going to be our friend,

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:19.300
but actually part of our
family. We love you Alvin.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.935
Thank you for everything.

00:04:20.935 --> 00:04:22.096
[Kelly] Aw!

00:04:22.096 --> 00:04:24.343
- I love you so so much, ladies!

00:04:24.343 --> 00:04:28.000
[Kelly] So I got to know,
girls how's Max doing?

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.418
He looks like he's taking a
pretty good nap right now.

00:04:30.418 --> 00:04:31.330
(Audience laughs)

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.539
- He is.

00:04:32.539 --> 00:04:35.440
[Kelly] Well, Max seems
like the cutest puppy in

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.680
all of the land.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:38.840
So I'm so glad that y'all
got to meet up like this.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.490
It's such a magical story.
Thank y'all for sharing with us.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:43.425
And you're today's real life Santa, Alvin.

00:04:43.425 --> 00:04:45.323
Um, and it comes with
more than just a title.

00:04:45.323 --> 00:04:48.418
Pilot G2 Gel Ink Pen is
designed for overachievers,

00:04:48.418 --> 00:04:51.987
just like you. And that's
why Pilots using their pen to

00:04:51.987 --> 00:04:54.635
write you a check for
$5,000. How's that sound?

00:04:54.635 --> 00:04:57.635
(Audience cheering)

00:05:01.358 --> 00:05:02.378
- Aw!

00:05:02.378 --> 00:05:04.208
[Alvin] Thank you so much! Sorry!

00:05:04.208 --> 00:05:05.133
- Alvin said sorry?

00:05:05.133 --> 00:05:06.802
[Kelly] Oh my gosh!

00:05:06.802 --> 00:05:07.635
- I'm sorry!

00:05:07.635 --> 00:05:08.468
- Sorry.

00:05:08.468 --> 00:05:09.301
[Kelly] Oh, don't be sorry.
I wish I could hug you

00:05:09.301 --> 00:05:11.680
right now. Join me won't you? I'm bawling.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.330
All right. Well thank y'all
so much, Merry Christmas!

